<title>UK: EIB adds 150 billion lire to March 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 150 billion lire to March 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 650 billion lire from 500 billion lire, lead manager Credito Italiano said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *150 BLN LIRE  COUPON     6.20	MATURITY    05.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.81     PAY DATE  **22.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS ***</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING 500 BLN LIRE LAUNCHED</p>
<p>		16.JAN.97</p>
<p>	    **PLUS 77 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>	   ***GENERAL SALES LIMITS OF EIB WITH SPECIFICATIONS FOR</p>
<p>		ITALY ONLY</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF ISSUERS DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
